WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:04.870
(FOOTSTEPS ECHOING)

00:00:05.004 --> 00:00:06.272
CERSEI:
<i> Enemies to the east.</i>

00:00:08.841 --> 00:00:10.243
<i> Enemies to the west.</i>

00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:14.080
<i> Enemies to the south.</i>

00:00:16.081 --> 00:00:17.384
<i> Enemies to the north.</i>

00:00:20.019 --> 00:00:21.554
<i>Whatever stands in our way...</i>

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:24.324
we will defeat it.

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:26.993
(FOOTSTEPS MARCHING)

00:00:27.093 --> 00:00:28.528
<i>We're the last Lannisters.</i>

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:32.132
<i> The last ones who count.</i>

00:00:37.937 --> 00:00:40.673
DAENERYS:<i> I was born
to rule the Seven Kingdoms...</i>

00:00:43.142 --> 00:00:44.411
<i> and I will.</i>

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.548
(SOLDIERS YELLING)

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:51.050
CROWD: The King in the North!

00:00:51.650 --> 00:00:53.118
LITTLEFINGER:<i> Your father
 and brothers are gone,</i>

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:54.421
<i> yet here you stand...</i>

00:00:56.522 --> 00:00:59.159
<i> last best hope
against the coming storm.</i>

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:04.330
(SIGHING)

00:01:04.997 --> 00:01:06.566
 SER DAVOS:<i> If we don't
 put aside our enmities</i>

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:08.301
<i> and band together,
 we will die.</i>

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:11.371
<i>And then it doesn't matter</i>

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:13.773
whose skeleton
sits on the Iron Throne.

00:01:24.784 --> 00:01:26.419
(DRAGON ROARING)

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.293
JON:<i> The Great War... is here.</i>

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:36.763
(WIND HOWLING)

